     <td style="vertical-align: top; width: 55.6%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">Data for 2025 is based on the finalized USEPA RFS2 standards.</td>
    </tr>

    <tr>
     <td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 1.2%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</td>
     <td style="vertical-align: top; width: 1.2%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</td>
     <td style="vertical-align: top; width: 55.6%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">**Figures for 2026 and 2027 reflect the proposed rule announced by the USEPA on June 13, 2025.</td>
    </tr>

   </tbody>
