<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"><b>Financials.</b></p>
<p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt;">The following sets forth our consolidated balance sheets as at December 31, 2025 and 2024&#160;and our consolidated statements of income and comprehensive income,&#160;cash flows, and&#160;changes in stockholders&#8217; equity for each of the three years in the period ended December 31, 2025, together with Grant Thornton&#160;LLP&#8217;s report as of and for&#160;the years ended December 31, 2025 and 2024,&#160;and RSM US LLP's report for the year ended December 31,&#160;2023.</p>
<p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt -1pt;">&#160;</p>
