  <p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; text-align: center; margin: 0pt;"><b><a id="compinc" title="compinc" href="#"></a>FutureFuel Corp.</b></p>
  <p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; text-align: center; margin: 0pt;"><b>Consolidated Statements of Income and Comprehensive Income</b></p>
  <p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; text-align: center; margin: 0pt;"><b>For the Years Ended December 31, 2025, 2024 and 2023</b></p>
  <p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; text-align: center; margin: 0pt;"><b>(Dollars in thousands, except per share amounts)</b></p>
