   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 35pt;"><b>Transaction price allocated to the remaining performance obligations of contract liabilities</b></p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 35pt;">As of <em style="font: inherit;"> December 31, 2025</em>, approximately $<ix:nonFraction id="c141989767" contextRef="i_2025-12-31_RevenueRemainingPerformanceObligationExpectedTimingOfSatisfactionStartDateAxis-RevenueRemainingPerformanceObligationExpectedTimingOfSatisfactionStartDateAxis.domain-2026-01-01" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:RevenueRemainingPerformanceObligation" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3">13,163</ix:nonFraction>&#160;of revenue is expected to be recognized in the future from remaining performance obligations. The Company expects to recognize this revenue ratably based upon the expected sales over the expected term of its long-term contracts which range from<span style="background-color:#ffffff;">&#160;<span style="-sec-ix-hidden:c141989768">two</span>&#160;to <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:c141989769">ten</span>&#160;y</span>ears. Approximately <ix:nonFraction id="c141989770" contextRef="i_2025-12-31_RevenueRemainingPerformanceObligationExpectedTimingOfSatisfactionStartDateAxis-RevenueRemainingPerformanceObligationExpectedTimingOfSatisfactionStartDateAxis.domain-2026-01-01" unitRef="Pure" name="us-gaap:RevenueRemainingPerformanceObligationPercentage" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="2">12</ix:nonFraction>% of this revenue is expected to be recognized over the next <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="i_2025-12-31_RevenueRemainingPerformanceObligationExpectedTimingOfSatisfactionStartDateAxis-RevenueRemainingPerformanceObligationExpectedTimingOfSatisfactionStartDateAxis.domain-2026-01-01" name="us-gaap:RevenueRemainingPerformanceObligationExpectedTimingOfSatisfactionPeriod1" id="c141989771" format="ixt-sec:durmonth">12</ix:nonNumeric> months, and <ix:nonFraction id="c141989772" contextRef="i_2025-12-31_RevenueRemainingPerformanceObligationExpectedTimingOfSatisfactionStartDateAxis-RevenueRemainingPerformanceObligationExpectedTimingOfSatisfactionStartDateAxis.domain-2027-01-01" unitRef="Pure" name="us-gaap:RevenueRemainingPerformanceObligationPercentage" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="2">88</ix:nonFraction>% is expected to be recognized between <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:c141989773">one</span> and <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:c141989774">nine</span>&#160;years. These amounts are subject to change based upon changes in the estimated contract life, estimated quantities, and most-likely expected sales price over the contract life. See Note <em style="font: inherit;">2</em> for further information.</p>
   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 35pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 44pt;"><b>Disaggregation of revenue - contractual and non-contractual</b></p>
