   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 35pt;">A LIFO&#160;liquidation of&#160;$<ix:nonFraction id="c141989802" contextRef="d_2024-01-01_2024-12-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:EffectOfLIFOInventoryLiquidationOnIncome" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3">435</ix:nonFraction>&#160;occurred in the year&#160;ended <em style="font: inherit;"> December 31,&#160;</em><em style="font: inherit;">2024.</em> There was <ix:nonFraction id="c141989804" contextRef="d_2025-01-01_2025-12-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:EffectOfLIFOInventoryLiquidationOnIncome" scale="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" decimals="-3">no</ix:nonFraction> liquidation in the years ended <em style="font: inherit;"> December 31, 2025 </em>or <em style="font: inherit;">2023.</em></p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;&#160;&#160;</p>
