</tbody></table>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 35pt;">Realized and unrealized gains and losses on derivative instruments and changes in fair value of the derivative instruments are recorded in the consolidated statements of income and comprehensive income as a component of cost of goods sold and amounted to a net gain of $<ix:nonFraction id="c141989807" contextRef="d_2025-01-01_2025-12-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:DerivativeInstrumentsNotDesignatedAsHedgingInstrumentsGainLossNet" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3">1,264</ix:nonFraction>&#160;for the year ended <em style="font: inherit;"> December 31, 2025,&#160;</em>a net loss&#160;of $<ix:nonFraction id="c141989808" contextRef="d_2024-01-01_2024-12-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:DerivativeInstrumentsNotDesignatedAsHedgingInstrumentsGainLossNet" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3" sign="-">499</ix:nonFraction>&#160;for the year ended <em style="font: inherit;"> December 31, 2024, </em>and a net gain&#160;of $<ix:nonFraction id="c141989809" contextRef="d_2023-01-01_2023-12-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:DerivativeInstrumentsNotDesignatedAsHedgingInstrumentsGainLossNet" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3">2,571</ix:nonFraction> for the year ended <em style="font: inherit;"> December 31, 2023.</em></p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 35pt;">The volumes and carrying values of the Company&#8217;s derivative instruments were as follows at <em style="font: inherit;"> December 31:</em></p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
