</tbody></table>
   </ix:nonNumeric>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 35pt;">The margin account maintained with a broker to collateralize these derivative instruments carried an account balance of $<ix:nonFraction id="c141989810" contextRef="i_2025-12-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:RestrictedCashAndCashEquivalents" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3">2,266</ix:nonFraction>&#160;and $<ix:nonFraction id="c141989811" contextRef="i_2024-12-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:RestrictedCashAndCashEquivalents" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3">877</ix:nonFraction>&#160;at <em style="font: inherit;"> December 31, 2025 </em>and <em style="font: inherit;">2024</em>, respectively, and is classified as other current assets in the consolidated balance sheets.&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
