   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 35pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 35pt;">Other noncurrent assets is primarily comprised of supplies and parts held for equipment maintenance and repairs&#160;which are <em style="font: inherit;">not</em> expected to be used in the <em style="font: inherit;">twelve</em>-month period subsequent to the consolidated balance sheet date. The balance related to these items totaled $<ix:nonFraction id="c141989836" contextRef="i_2025-12-31_BalanceSheetLocationAxis-OtherAssetsMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:OtherAssetsNoncurrent" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3">4,329</ix:nonFraction>&#160;and $<ix:nonFraction id="c141989837" contextRef="i_2024-12-31_BalanceSheetLocationAxis-OtherAssetsMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:OtherAssetsNoncurrent" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3">4,376</ix:nonFraction>&#160;at <em style="font: inherit;"> December 31, 2025 </em>and <em style="font: inherit;">2024</em>, respectively.</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;&#160;</p>
  </ix:nonNumeric>
