   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 35pt;">The Company prospectively adopted&#160;ASU&#160;<em style="font: inherit;">No.</em> <em style="font: inherit;">2023</em>-<em style="font: inherit;">09</em><i>&#160;</i>(see Note <em style="font: inherit;">2</em> for further details) which&#160;requires disaggregated information about a reporting entity&#8217;s effective tax rate reconciliation as well as additional disclosure on income taxes paid.</p>
   <p style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; margin: 0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 35pt;">The following table summarizes the income (or loss) before income&#160;tax (or benefit) and the income tax (or benefit) from continuing operations for the&#160;years ended:</p>
   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 35pt;">&#160;</p>
