     <td style="width: auto;"> <p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"><span style="background-color:#ffffff">Mr. Polet&#160;was appointed Chief Executive&#160;Officer effective September 3, 2024.&#160; Mr. Polet was issued&#160;750,000 RSUs&#160;that vest annually on the anniversary date.&#160; These RSUs and related dividends had an intrinsic value of $4,519 and $392, respectively.&#160;</span></p> </td>
    </tr>

