  <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
  <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 35pt;"><b>Grants of Plan-Based Awards&#160;</b></p>
  <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 36pt; text-indent: 0pt;">&#160;</p>
  <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 36pt; text-indent: 0pt;">In&#160;2024, the Company issued 750,000 RSUs to Roeland Polet, the Company&#8217;s Chief Executive Officer in connection with his Employment Agreement. The RSUs vest in five equal installments on each anniversary of the award date, September 3, 2024. The&#160;total expense of the award was valued at $4,911&#160;at the grant date inclusive of dividends. The RSUs were estimated at $4,519 and will be recognized as compensation expense over the vesting period.&#160;&#160;The compensation expense recorded in 2025 and 2024 was $1,092 and $392, respectively.&#160;The equivalent dividends earned on the RSUs are forfeitable and recorded as a reduction in retained earnings and an increase in additional paid in capital.&#160;</p>
  <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 36pt; text-indent: 0pt;">&#160;</p>
  <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 36pt; text-indent: 0pt;">In 2025, the Company issued 5,012 shares of restricted stock to each of Ms. Sparks and Mr. Gaither. The awards vest 33% each year over a three-year period.</p>
  <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
